1330
00:57:25,589 --> 00:57:28,288
The receipt for earned income tax withholding.

1331
00:57:28,289 --> 00:57:30,288
- Right. - That was needed as well.

1332
00:57:30,289 --> 00:57:31,319
But...

1333
00:57:31,829 --> 00:57:33,488
I can get that issued...

1334
