1361
00:58:31,479 --> 00:58:33,088
- He must be really nervous. - It's up there.

1362
00:58:33,089 --> 00:58:34,219
- Via e-mail. - Right.

1363
00:58:35,259 --> 00:58:36,789
- That's done. - Right.

1364
00:58:36,819 --> 00:58:39,088
Now, you have to fill out this application.

1365
00:58:39,089 --> 00:58:40,089
Right.

1366
