1377
00:59:02,679 --> 00:59:04,718
It's better for the duration to be longer, right?

1378
00:59:04,719 --> 00:59:06,048
- Right. The principal lowers. - The principal lowers.

1379
00:59:06,049 --> 00:59:08,618
