1382
00:59:12,459 --> 00:59:13,828
That will be around 600 dollars a month.

1383
00:59:13,829 --> 00:59:14,988
- So... - Yes?

1384
00:59:14,989 --> 00:59:16,798
- that will be... - From your pay.

1385
00:59:16,799 --> 00:59:18,668
