01:23:38,679 --> 01:23:39,749
It's too cramped.

2064
01:23:40,949 --> 01:23:43,019
(I wish the restroom weren't so small.)

2065
01:23:43,159 --> 01:23:44,789
This is a 1.5-room apartment,

2066
01:23:45,089 --> 01:23:46,559
so there's a room further inside.

2067
01:23:47,359 --> 01:23:49,999
Once there's a bed inside,

2068
01:23:51,099 --> 01:23:52,129
it'll be like this.

2069
01:23:55,129 --> 01:23:56,299
So my bed will go here.

2070
01:23:56,599 --> 01:23:58,539
Where will I store my clothes?

2071
01:23:59,809 --> 01:24:02,039
- This place doesn't have a closet. - You're right.

2072
01:24:02,309 --> 01:24:04,438
That's why a 1.5-room apartment can be a bit difficult.

2073
01:24:04,439 --> 01:24:05,439
I see.

2074
01:24:05,440 --> 01:24:07,548
These days, 1.5-room apartments don't have much storage space.

2075
01:24:07,549 --> 01:24:09,819
- This property is the same. - There's no built-in closet.

2076
01:24:10,619 --> 01:24:12,549
That's right. It's a bit small.

2077
01:24:14,919 --> 01:24:16,018
(Still, I'll record everything.)

2078
01:24:16,019 --> 01:24:17,019
Still...

2079
01:24:17,020 --> 01:24:18,959
(Still, I'll record everything.)

2080
01:24:20,789 --> 01:24:23,629
(He takes photos this time as well.)

2081
01:24:24,429 --> 01:24:25,898
There won't be much noise.

2082
01:24:25,899 --> 01:24:28,198
Circulation. Circulation is good.

2083
01:24:28,199 --> 01:24:29,439
The water pressure is good.

2084
01:24:30,099 --> 01:24:31,568
Not much storage space.

2085
01:24:31,569 --> 01:24:33,039
(He makes a memo of the shortcomings.)

2086
01:24:35,309 --> 01:24:38,609
There are some things I'll have to endure.

2087
01:24:39,549 --> 01:24:41,878
(This isn't easy.)

2088
01:24:41,879 --> 01:24:43,479
It isn't easy to find a place.

2089
01:24:44,519 --> 01:24:46,188
I've lived only in properties with monthly rent in the past.

2090
01:24:46,189 --> 01:24:47,688
The lump-sum deposit wasn't very big.

2091
01:24:47,689 --> 01:24:50,259
In university towns, it was as cheap as 5,000 dollars.

2092
01:24:50,819 --> 01:24:52,158
At most, it was 10,000 dollars.

2093
01:24:52,159 --> 01:24:53,259
Nowadays,

2094
01:24:54,459 --> 01:24:56,359
the amount of money that goes into finding a place...

2095
01:24:56,799 --> 01:24:58,159
has another zero.

2096
01:24:59,029 --> 01:25:01,829
I might have to borrow some money from my parents too.

2097
01:25:02,669 --> 01:25:04,139
The level of responsibility is different.

2098
01:25:05,169 --> 01:25:08,069
My anxiety level was on another level.

2099
01:25:09,069 --> 01:25:11,578
While I'm trying not to have too many expectations,

2100
01:25:11,579 --> 01:25:15,909
this is a house I'll live in for the next two years at the least.

2101
01:25:16,919 --> 01:25:20,119
I'll visit more properties on the weekends...

2102
01:25:20,749 --> 01:25:23,389
to find a place I can be satisfied with.

2103
01:25:24,119 --> 01:25:25,758
It must've been hard to view all the properties.

2104
01:25:25,759 --> 01:25:27,489
- Please keep in touch. - Thank you.

2105
01:25:28,989 --> 01:25:31,799
I thought I'd get hooked on the last place.

2106
01:25:32,059 --> 01:25:33,199
It's too bad.

2107
01:25:35,499 --> 01:25:37,198
Viewing properties isn't an easy task.

2108
01:25:37,199 --> 01:25:39,198
(This Is How You Become An Adult)

2109
01:25:39,199 --> 01:25:40,709
(Next week)

2110
01:25:41,369 --> 01:25:42,438
(He has eagerly waited...)

2111
01:25:42,439 --> 01:25:44,009
(to meet his role model.)

2112
01:25:44,909 --> 01:25:46,478
(Mr. Ito Junji!)

2113
01:25:46,479 --> 01:25:47,509
(Moved)

2114
01:25:48,079 --> 01:25:50,419
(He finally faced his idol of many years.)

2115
01:25:51,479 --> 01:25:52,889
(I couldn't close my mouth.)

2116
01:25:54,289 --> 01:25:55,889
(I...)

2117
01:25:56,559 --> 01:25:58,218
(The appearance of his idol...)

2118
01:25:58,219 --> 01:26:00,059
(scrambles his brain.)

2119
01:26:00,989 --> 01:26:01,989
(Anxious)

2120
01:26:01,990 --> 01:26:02,999
(I wanted to pee.)

2121
01:26:03,829 --> 01:26:05,028
(I saw your drawing.)

2122
01:26:05,029 --> 01:26:06,369
(It was cute.)

2123
01:26:07,499 --> 01:26:08,868
(Did Ito Junji see my drawing?)

2124
01:26:08,869 --> 01:26:09,939
(What an honor)

2125
01:26:10,669 --> 01:26:11,669
(And...)

2126
01:26:11,670 --> 01:26:12,869
(he prepared something for him.)

2127
01:26:13,169 --> 01:26:14,338
(Kian84's....)

2128
01:26:14,339 --> 01:26:16,009
(packed meal with Ito Junji's vibe)

2129
01:26:16,479 --> 01:26:17,479
(I'll enjoy the food.)

2130
01:26:17,879 --> 01:26:19,039
(How does it taste?)

2131
01:26:20,949 --> 01:26:23,279
Hold on. I can't watch this.

2132
01:26:24,479 --> 01:26:26,819
(And...)

2133
01:26:29,289 --> 01:26:31,088
(I became...)

2134
01:26:31,089 --> 01:26:33,089
(a bit emotional then.)

2135
01:26:33,929 --> 01:26:36,999
(Ito Junji felt his sincerity.)

2136
01:26:37,959 --> 01:26:39,528
(Why couldn't I become...)

2137
01:26:39,529 --> 01:26:42,939
(a great cartoonist like him?)

2138
01:26:47,239 --> 01:26:51,809
(The Man Who Makes Me Dream)

2139
01:26:53,049 --> 01:26:55,308
(The man who doesn't allow a speck of dust,)

2140
01:26:55,309 --> 01:26:57,479
(Bae Na Ra)

2141
01:26:58,049 --> 01:27:00,919
(He's committed to his routine.)

2142
01:27:01,749 --> 01:27:03,088
(He leads a neat life. He seems like a nice man.)

2143
01:27:03,089 --> 01:27:04,489
(Seeing Bae Na Ra's neatness and calmness puts me at ease.)

2144
01:27:05,059 --> 01:27:06,829
(He fills each day with his unique rhythm.)

2145
01:27:08,489 --> 01:27:10,458
(As long as I have a sleep mask and ear plugs,)

2146
01:27:10,459 --> 01:27:12,399
(I can go anywhere.)

2147
01:27:13,029 --> 01:27:14,029
It's hot.

2148
01:27:14,030 --> 01:27:16,129
(It has been a week since my last performance ended.)

2149
01:27:16,469 --> 01:27:18,638
(For his hard work, he gave himself...)

2150
01:27:18,639 --> 01:27:20,039
(a camping day.)

2151
01:27:20,869 --> 01:27:22,309
(Peeking)

2152
01:27:22,979 --> 01:27:24,378
(He can enjoy solitude...)

2153
01:27:24,379 --> 01:27:25,509
(at his secret spot on the beach.)

2154
01:27:26,509 --> 01:27:28,449
(He has enjoyed camping for 4 years.)

2155
01:27:29,149 --> 01:27:31,219
(Na Ra's another house)

2156
01:27:31,749 --> 01:27:33,919
(Each item has its place.)

2157
01:27:34,549 --> 01:27:35,949
(His second sweet home)

2158
01:27:36,519 --> 01:27:38,259
(Thorough)

2159
01:27:39,419 --> 01:27:40,828
(He has his unique know-how...)

2160
01:27:40,829 --> 01:27:42,559
(for maintaining his routine.)

2161
01:27:43,159 --> 01:27:45,159
(Eating well is essential.)

2162
01:27:46,029 --> 01:27:48,669
(He takes care of himself with each and every meal.)

2163
01:27:49,229 --> 01:27:50,339
(Salivating)

2164
01:27:50,699 --> 01:27:52,169
(Na Ra's meal)

2165
01:27:52,969 --> 01:27:55,369
(This is how a man with a routine enjoys camping.)

2166
01:27:56,169 --> 01:27:58,209
(Does he have a running routine?)

2167
01:27:58,909 --> 01:28:00,649
(The webfoot octopus run is all the rage these days.)

2168
01:28:01,309 --> 01:28:03,349
(Webfoot octopus, I'm on my way!)

2169
01:28:03,779 --> 01:28:05,519
