2171
01:28:08,489 --> 01:28:09,519
(Gosh, I'm exhausted.)

2172
01:28:10,219 --> 01:28:12,119
(Na Ra will collapse before he gets webfoot octopus.)

2173
01:28:12,459 --> 01:28:14,029
(- They aren't in season yet. - You don't sell them?)

2174
01:28:14,729 --> 01:28:16,929
(The webfoot octopus run loses its purpose.)

2175
01:28:17,829 --> 01:28:20,469
(Webfoot octopus, this has to be a lie.)

2176
01:28:21,169 --> 01:28:23,169
(He feels empty as if there's a hole in his heart.)

2177
01:28:23,899 --> 01:28:27,669
(Na Ra Camping With Ups And Downs)
